		{"id":"d46ce4b10376b255","type":"group","x":-280,"y":-64,"width":560,"height":602,"color":"5","label":"Producto y Tecnología"},
		{"id":"304e446b75fbb4be","type":"text","text":"# 🏛️ El Consejo\n\n**Emilio** (Comercial) · **Eduardo** (Operativo)\n\nNo son jefes de tarea. Aprueban solo:\n1. Dinero comprometido con un cliente\n2. Publicar a producción / mandar algo a un cliente\n3. Documentos que se firman\n4. Aceptar/rechazar proyecto y fechas\n5. Exponer datos personales o credenciales","x":-310,"y":-1700,"width":620,"height":336},
		{"id":"630cff94113ec872","type":"file","file":"01-Empresa/09-Organigrama.md","x":-310,"y":-1144,"width":620,"height":300,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"b2f9e55cbc27401c","type":"file","file":"01-Empresa/00-Contexto-Empresarial.md","x":-2105,"y":-584,"width":340,"height":220},
		{"id":"59b89689abab2951","type":"file","file":"01-Empresa/01-Servicios-y-Paquetes.md","x":-1675,"y":-584,"width":340,"height":220},
		{"id":"45d97dc1f844afbc","type":"file","file":"01-Empresa/03-Perfiles-de-Cliente.md","x":-1245,"y":-584,"width":340,"height":220},
		{"id":"4a0efda9f4be4362","type":"file","file":"01-Empresa/04-Proceso-6-Fases.md","x":-815,"y":-584,"width":340,"height":220},
		{"id":"c999a1ae5849ca6d","type":"file","file":"01-Empresa/05-Tono-de-Voz.md","x":-385,"y":-584,"width":340,"height":220},
		{"id":"760a8fe513356a3e","type":"file","file":"01-Empresa/06-Identidad-de-Marca.md","x":45,"y":-584,"width":340,"height":220},
		{"id":"e845abae8ac7531f","type":"file","file":"01-Empresa/07-Stack-Tecnologico.md","x":475,"y":-584,"width":340,"height":220},
		{"id":"2f114e03fece0b66","type":"file","file":"01-Empresa/08-KPIs.md","x":905,"y":-584,"width":340,"height":220},
		{"id":"e3871939f19cbcc1","type":"text","text":"### Ingeniería y SEO Técnico\n`ingenieria`\n\n**Dueño de:** Código, infraestructura, deploy, SEO técnico y local (NAP, Google Business, sitemap, Search Console — absorbió a `growth-seo`)\n\n**Responde por:** Tiempo de carga, errores en producción, posiciones, indexación","x":-250,"y":26,"width":500,"height":211,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"b219ce30cb1033bc","type":"file","file":"05-Operacion/Decisiones.md","x":1335,"y":-584,"width":340,"height":220},
		{"id":"c1e329079aa972d7","type":"file","file":"00-Inbox/_estado.md","x":1765,"y":-584,"width":340,"height":220},
		{"id":"fd02179a81c280fd","type":"text","text":"### Comercial\n`ventas`\n\n**Dueño de:** Embudo: prospecto → diagnóstico → propuesta → cierre\n\n**Responde por:** Nuevos clientes/mes, tasa de cierre, calidad del cliente cerrado","x":-1890,"y":26,"width":500,"height":274,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"d00f7745dc3007ec","type":"text","text":"### Marketing y Contenido\n`marketing`\n\n**Dueño de:** Posicionamiento, canales, generación de demanda, competencia, copy de sitios/redes, calendario editorial, voz de marca (absorbió a `contenido`)\n\n**Responde por:** Prospectos por canal, costo en horas por prospecto, copy aprobado","x":-1890,"y":350,"width":500,"height":274,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"704559fcfbf31c47","type":"text","text":"### Producto Conversacional\n`producto-ia`\n\n**Dueño de:** Flujos de Typebot\n\n**Responde por:** Tasa de conversión del asistente","x":-250,"y":287,"width":500,"height":211,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"95d15524f2256566","type":"text","text":"## 📂 03-Prospectos/\n\nSin prospectos reales todavía. Un archivo por lead, `/prospecto <negocio>`.","x":-1860,"y":1384,"width":440,"height":163},
		{"id":"7aa7cc2d6fd0a046","type":"text","text":"### Diseño — construye la web\n`diseno`\n\n**Dueño de:** Sistema visual, jerarquía, UX, movimiento\n\n**Responde por:** Que un negocio local se vea serio","x":-1070,"y":350,"width":500,"height":211,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"e72911ce99be384f","type":"file","file":"04-Marketing/Posts/reel-3-senales-perdiendo-clientes.md","x":-1040,"y":1384,"width":440,"height":260},
		{"id":"f78d663438c56a7c","type":"text","text":"### Finanzas\n`finanzas`\n\n**Dueño de:** Costeo, precios, margen, flujo, cobranza\n\n**Responde por:** Margen por proyecto, utilidad, cartera vencida","x":570,"y":26,"width":500,"height":243,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"2b53ed1fa2c0c1bd","type":"text","text":"### Legal y Cumplimiento\n`legal`\n\n**Dueño de:** Avisos de privacidad, LFPDPPP, riesgos\n\n**Responde por:** Que ningún sitio salga sin cumplir","x":570,"y":319,"width":500,"height":211,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"a95378e05a55d413","type":"text","text":"### Datos y Analítica\n`datos`\n\n**Dueño de:** KPIs, reportes, patrones\n\n**Responde por:** Que se decida con números, no con impresiones","x":570,"y":580,"width":500,"height":243,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"dbdd4d43a011bf0a","type":"file","file":"05-Operacion/Finanzas/Precios.md","x":600,"y":1384,"width":440,"height":260},
		{"id":"604033f20b6e6b4a","type":"file","file":"05-Operacion/Finanzas/Cobros.md","x":600,"y":1714,"width":440,"height":260},
		{"id":"5c9be8d48cfc0761","type":"text","text":"### Operaciones (PMO)\n`operaciones`\n\n**Dueño de:** Fases, capacidad, calidad, control de alcance\n\n**Responde por:** Entregas a tiempo, horas facturables vs. disponibles","x":1390,"y":26,"width":500,"height":243,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"27bce7018127456e","type":"text","text":"### Contratación\n`contratacion`\n\n**Dueño de:** Ficha de pago y bienvenida al cerrar\n\n**Responde por:** Que el cliente arranque el mismo día","x":1390,"y":319,"width":500,"height":211,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"883b658f600a2a59","type":"text","text":"### Customer Success\n`soporte`\n\n**Dueño de:** Clientes entregados, retención\n\n**Responde por:** MRR y churn","x":1390,"y":580,"width":500,"height":211,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"8e4f94c881562eec","type":"text","text":"### Personas\n`people`\n\n**Dueño de:** Procesos internos, quién decide qué\n\n**Responde por:** Que el conocimiento no viva en una sola cabeza","x":1390,"y":841,"width":500,"height":243,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"fc2d747bacb034d2","type":"text","text":"## 📂 02-Clientes/\n\nSin clientes reales todavía. Solo se ha corrido el pipeline completo con demos (ficticios, ya borrados).","x":1420,"y":1384,"width":440,"height":163},
		{"id":"251e4f5e98459caf","type":"file","file":"07-Recursos/Agentes-y-Herramientas/00-Registro-de-Agentes.md","x":1420,"y":1850,"width":440,"height":260},
		{"id":"1f58c389b6d1d6dd","type":"file","file":"05-Operacion/Reportes-Semanales/2026-08-19.md","x":600,"y":2044,"width":440,"height":260},
		{"id":"ad81a9dc737eab0e","type":"file","file":"99-Archivo/modelo-6-funciones-reemplazado-2026-08-20.md","x":1420,"y":2180,"width":440,"height":260},
		{"id":"faa60d6e7e2cc8eb","type":"text","text":"## 📄 06-Plantillas/\n\n16 plantillas base, se copian y no se editan. Ver `00-Indice-Plantillas`.","x":1420,"y":1600,"width":440,"height":163},
		{"id":"a1b2c3d4e5f6a7b8","type":"text","text":"# 🧭 Gerencia\n`gerencia`\n\nRevisa el trabajo agregado entre departamentos (empieza por el reporte semanal) con criterio de administración de empresa, y lo autoriza. No repite las decisiones que cada departamento ya tomó.\n\n**Nuevo nivel 2026-08-29** entre los 12 departamentos y el consejo.","x":450,"y":-1430,"width":500,"height":280,"color":"4"}
	],
